# Symbulator circuit book

title: Circuits for Lesson 6 of the Tutorial (Part 3)

[Bo2's Figure 5.38 (Impulse)]

j,0,1,i*DiracDelta(t)
c,1,0,c,0
r,1,0,r

analysis: tr
note: The impulse survives in the capacitor's current, which is right: the charge arrives all at once.
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes


